        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Minesweeper × Tower Defense</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine? Tower! is a Minesweeper-inspired tower defense puzzle game where every tile can change the run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reveal safe tiles, read the numbers, flag hidden mines, and turn confirmed mine tiles into towers. Each decision gives you more information, more space, or more defense — but one wrong step can end the run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How It Plays</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deduce the board</strong> — Numbers show how many mines are hidden around each opened tile.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flag mines</strong> — Mark confirmed mines before they become a threat.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build towers</strong> — Spend build points to construct towers on flagged mine tiles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend the castle</strong> — Keep enemies from breaking through while you continue solving the board.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Restart quickly</strong> — Short runs make it easy to try a better route, faster clear, or higher score.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzle Logic Meets Defense Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine? Tower! is not just about clearing tiles. You need to balance risk, information, and tower placement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Opening more tiles can reveal the path forward, but it can also expose danger. Building early can stabilize your defense, but saving build points may give you better options later.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hybrid of classic Minesweeper logic and tower defense strategy</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short, replayable runs built around quick retries</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score and clear-time leaderboards</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple mouse-based controls with useful shortcuts</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal 2D presentation focused on readability and decision-making</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Left Click</strong> — Open a tile, or build a tower on a flagged mine tile</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Right Click</strong> — Place or remove a flag</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chord / Auto-Open</strong> — Use left+right click, double-click, or middle mouse on an opened number</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>R</strong> — Restart</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ESC</strong> — Pause / Menu</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All screenshots are taken from actual gameplay.</p>",
