ass=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score and clear-time leaderboards</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple mouse-based controls with useful shortcuts</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal 2D presentation focused on readability and decision-making</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Left Click</strong> — Open a tile, or build a tower on a flagged mine tile</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Right Click</strong> — Place or remove a flag</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chord / Auto-Open</strong> — Use left+right click, double-click, or middle mouse on an opened number</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>R</strong> — Restart</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ESC</strong> — Pause / Menu</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All screenshots are taken from actual gameplay.</p>",
